      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T03:19:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The eventual goal is [building the Cuttlefish host tools on darwin](http://go/cf-macos). In this case, the dependency comes from [`secure_env`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:device/google/cuttlefish/host/commands/secure_env/Android.bp;l\u003d151;drc\u003d206bb9f9cca5f81411da6ddd583f0e25147289b1) to [`libkmr_cf_ffi`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:device/google/cuttlefish/host/commands/secure_env/rust/Android.bp;l\u003d48;drc\u003d008a2761144a83505bb1b5720921f7b31337a10f) which is a `rust_ffi_host` target and has a collection of indirect rust crate dependencies.",
      "parentUuid": "b918d5ed_d5162d8a",
      "revId": "0e0d49448b31e813bf535fbc4e27d13dbe689ef7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
