      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T04:19:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I should also mention that unfortunately this CL isn\u0027t the end of the story for support, as past the point of these issues [ld64.lld crashes](https://paste.googleplex.com/5240358861537280) when building `libkmr_cf`. The same command succeeds when replacing the AOSP prebuilt `clang` with the system `clang`, but I\u0027m still looking into it.",
      "parentUuid": "68520e00_32c6229a",
      "revId": "0e0d49448b31e813bf535fbc4e27d13dbe689ef7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d862a1e2_e036cbd3",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
