      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T22:15:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the clarification. This project is definitely targeted only at host mac binaries, which I assumed were covered under the \"platform-tools\" category mentioned in go/android-macos-deprecation .\n\nThanks for the instructions, I\u0027ll file a bug with more details. What I can see so far is that the error has something to do with universal binary support: the l64.lld failure stops when I manually pull out the arm64 inputs and create a pure x86_64 executable.",
      "parentUuid": "35b2675e_f7875d6b",
      "revId": "0e0d49448b31e813bf535fbc4e27d13dbe689ef7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
